remedied by imposing monetary and Remedial and Regulatory Term including
imposition of higher settlement amount on the applicant, the settlement of such
defaults may be considered.
(3) The modification of the allegation may be sought in case the Panel of Whole Time
Member, is of the opinion that the facts disclose a different default.

